# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
#
# Trading 212 keys are DELIBERATELY named differently per environment. A single
# key plus a MODE flag is one typo away from trading real money, so the base URL
# is derived from which key is present rather than from a switch.
#
#   Demo key:  switch the Trading 212 app to Practice mode BEFORE generating it,
#              otherwise you get a live key.
#   Live key:  generated while the app is in real-money mode.
#
# Research and backtest processes must run WITHOUT T212_LIVE_API_KEY in their
# environment. `tb` asserts this.

T212_DEMO_API_KEY=
# T212_LIVE_API_KEY=          # leave unset until you intend to trade real money

# --- Market data (Trading 212 provides none) -------------------------------
# Alpaca is the primary feed. Generate these on an Alpaca **paper** account:
# Alpaca issues keys per account, not per scope, so there is no data-only key —
# a key made on a funded live account can place orders on it. Paper keys serve
# the same market-data API and cannot move money.
#
#   alpaca.markets -> sign up -> pick the paper account (top-left) ->
#   API Keys in the right sidebar -> Generate New Keys. The secret is shown once.
#
# The free Basic plan is IEX-only for equities, roughly 2% of consolidated
# volume. That is a real limit on what can be traded, not a detail:
# `tb data bakeoff` measures it and `data.allowed_live_resolutions` stays
# [daily] until it says otherwise.
#
# Alpaca's own SDK reads APCA_API_KEY_ID / APCA_API_SECRET_KEY. Those names are
# deliberately NOT read here, and a key found under them is reported rather than
# used — this process executes through Trading 212 and has no business holding a
# key that can trade somewhere else.
ALPACA_DATA_KEY_ID=
ALPACA_DATA_SECRET_KEY=

# --- Optional: LLM strategy proposer ---------------------------------------
# Omit entirely to use the deterministic genetic searcher (the default).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Paths (defaults are fine) ---------------------------------------------
# TB_HARD_LIMITS_PATH=config/hard_limits.yaml
# TB_VAR_DIR=var
